e lower third and a baking sheet on it. Line the pie plate with one crust.","uses":[0]},{"text":"Toss the apples with the sugar, cornstarch, cinnamon, nutmeg, salt and lemon juice. Pile them into the crust, mounding them in the center, and dot with the butter.","uses":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8]},{"text":"Lay the second crust over the top, trim, fold the edges under and crimp to seal. Cut {count 5} slits in the top. Brush with the egg and sprinkle with sugar.","uses":[9,10]},{"text":"Bake on the hot baking sheet for {time 20 min}. Lower the heat to {temp 375F oven} and bake until the crust is deep golden and the filling bubbles thickly through the slits, {time 40-50 min}. Cover the edges with foil if they brown too fast.","uses":[]},{"text":"Cool the pie completely, at least {time 4 hr notimer}, before slicing, or the filling will run.","uses":[]}]}